+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| full-22 | fp32 | 65.04 | 64.36 | +0.00 | [+0.00, +0.00] |
+| full-22 | int8 | 65.30 | 64.64 | +0.26 | [+0.07, +0.47] |
